Exit codes:
  0    every record was answered and every --require held
  1    a --require did not hold
  2    usage or validation error, including a bad label or record
  3    the key was refused, the account is out of credits, the keychain failed, or
       profiles.json or credentials.json is exposed. No report prints
  6    the report holds one or more errors, which wins over 1
  130  interrupted. No report prints

